{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join Us On A Journey </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/520120/extras/72487b7d1ff902addb4814826467d078.poster.avif?t=1496232133\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/520120/extras/72487b7d1ff902addb4814826467d078.apng?t=1496232133\" class=\"bb_img\" width=29 height=16 /></picture></span></h2> </h2>as we develop Vanguard V in this Early Access release. This title features the original 2014 prototype level and a <strong>completely new level! </strong>Level 2 also has developer commentary, simply hit the &quot;Enter&quot; key to get behind-the-scenes info as you play. Also, make sure to check out the Developer Corner to hear from the developers directly in 360 video. Videos are updated alongside the game. Your support will directly help this title reach the finish line!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/520120/extras/b292982be4b8f7ba46d0b856a1aff16e.poster.avif?t=1496232133\" width=420 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/520120/extras/b292982be4b8f7ba46d0b856a1aff16e.webm?t=1496232133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/520120/extras/b292982be4b8f7ba46d0b856a1aff16e.mp4?t=1496232133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>JackSepticEye playing the 2014 Vanguard V Prototype</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/520120/extras/65d5f698f4d9450ae157c0d841f83b6d.avif?t=1496232133\" width=135 height=116 /></span>                <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_i